 "answer_verbatim": "**Title Partners Agency** looks like a strong option to start with for a St. Louis home closing. Its site features positive client comments about responsiveness, clear communication, and help with unusual closing issues; its Yelp snippets also mention reasonable fees and quick turnaround. It’s at **12444 Powerscourt Drive, Suite 200, St. Louis, MO 63131**, and lists **(314) 835-3600**.\n\nThere isn’t enough consistent, independent review data here to call any company definitively “the best.” Before choosing, ask your lender whether they have requirements, then compare the **total title and closing fees**, who will handle your file, and how quickly they respond. You can also compare **Title Resources Inc.**, which reports a 5.0 Google rating from 92 reviews in the available results.",
